# English-only project

The user may chat in Italian. **All project content must be in English.**

## In English

- Source code: identifiers, strings shown in logs/UI, error messages
- Comments and docstrings
- Notebook markdown cells and printed labels
- README, docs, commit messages, PR descriptions
- Cursor rules and other repo config text meant for the project

## Chat language

- Replies to the user may follow the user's language (Italian is fine).
- Do not put Italian into code, docs, or other project files unless the user explicitly asks for a translation artifact.
